cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these benchmarks or measurement data, please cite using the metadata below."
title: "PQC Benchmarks on WSN-Class Hardware (RP2040 + ESP32)"
abstract: >-
  On-device measurement campaign for NIST post-quantum signature standards
  (FN-DSA-512, ML-DSA-44, SLH-DSA-128s), ML-KEM-512, and an ECDSA-P256 baseline
  on ARM Cortex-M0+ (RP2040) and Xtensa LX6 (ESP32): firmware, capture and
  analysis scripts, raw serial captures, and generated latency, memory, and
  energy tables.
type: software
